    "penalty0": "If the Athlete fails to dive within a reasonable time frame after the Referee’s warning (with a maximum of 1 minute after the Referee’s warning).",
    "@penalty0": {
        "description": "Penalty Descripion List\n Penalty 0 - 8.5.5 - If the Athlete fails to dive within a reasonable time frame after the Referee’s warning (with a maximum of one (1) minute after the Referee’s warning).",
        "type": "text"
    },
    "penalty1": "If in a springboard dive, an Athlete double bounces during the approach or on the end of the springboard.",
