        "description": "Penalty 1 - 8.6.5.2 - 10.3.4 - If in a springboard dive, an Athlete double bounces during the approach or on the end of the springboard.",
        "type": "text"
    },
    "penalty2": "If in a running dive, the Athlete’s the final step or jump before a two-footed take-off is also from two feet.",
